<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - Oct 10.</title>
<headline>Philippine 24-hour weather forecast - Oct 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>++++</p>
<p>STORM ALERT: All Clear</p>
<p>				     ++++</p>
<p>METRO MANILA --  Partly cloudy. Winds light, blowing from the</p>
<p>			northeast to east, Manila Bay slight,</p>
<p>			temperature - 23 to 32 degrees celsius</p>
<p> BAGUIO	 --  Partly cloudy. Winds light to moderate</p>
<p>			blowing from the northeast. Temperature - 16</p>
<p>			to 24 degrees celsius.</p>
<p> METRO CEBU   --  Cloudy with rainshowers and thunderstorms.</p>
<p>			Winds light blowing from the northeast to</p>
<p>			east. Temperature - 25 to 31 degrees celsius.</p>
<p>METRO DAVAO  --  Cloudy with rainshowers and thunderstorms.</p>
<p>			Winds light from the northeast to east.</p>
<p>			Temperature - 24 to 31 degrees celsius.</p>
</text>
